5,1,1,talk,George,,"We should establish a clear system. I'm worried that if we don't address the underlying tension, any new rule will just be another point of conflict.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree. The current informal arrangement is inefficient. We need to understand exactly how our time and money are being spent before we commit to a new structure.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I think we need to look at the actual daily experience. It's not just about the money, but whether the car is available and ready when needed.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I want to ensure we aren't unintentionally subsidizing each other. We need a system that reflects actual usage to keep things fair for everyone.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I just want us all to be happy. Maybe if we see the real numbers, we can find a way that feels honest and kind to everyone?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,George,,"@Minato, kindness is good, but clarity prevents resentment. I want to see how other households handle this to avoid the common pitfalls that sour these friendships.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@George, that's a practical approach. I'm particularly interested in the administrative burden. We should examine the hours spent on coordination and the frequency of repetitive trips.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I'm concerned about the car's condition. If we are to share it, we must ensure it's maintained. I'd like to see the mechanic's notes and the handover state.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I agree with @Toshio on the usage patterns. I'll look into the fuel receipts and the diary hours to see where the costs are actually falling.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,I think looking at the tax and insurance papers would be helpful too. I want to know the total cost for the year so we aren't guessing.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,George,,Let's make sure we also look at the trial recording of runs. It will show us the reality of our habits rather than our memories.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,That makes sense. I will also check the spell of checking each other's figures to see how much friction that process creates.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I believe we should also consider the weeks of heavy use. It helps identify if the car is being overstressed during certain periods.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll also check the tax and insurance papers. I want to see the fixed costs versus the variable ones to determine a fair split.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,I'm curious about what other households do. Maybe they have a way of paying that doesn't make people feel bad?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
